cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Physiscore"
abstract: >-
  Integrated, physics-constrained analysis suite for thin-film photovoltaic
  device and material characterization, covering J-V (light and dark), EQE,
  absorbance, photoluminescence, Raman, FTIR, XRD, SEM and XPS.
version: "2.0.0"
